# What each surface is drawn from, for `shots` without surfaces: a change to a file under any of a
# surface's paths renders it. One per line, `SURFACE PATH...`; `*` is every shell surface, kobo
# and specimen are the iced renderers', terminals is test/shots/terminals', and plymouth, grub and
# cursor are the boot screens' and the pointer's (test/shots/boot). The services are stand-ins
# (fakes/qs/services), so a change to config/quickshell/services renders nothing.
